{"id":"word:hebrew:H835","type":"word","title":"אֶשֶׁר","subtitle":"H835 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"happiness ; only in masculine plural construction as interjection, how happy!","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אֶשֶׁר (H835) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 45 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אֶשֶׁר (ʼesher) means happiness ; only in masculine plural construction as interjection, how happy! First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 10 8."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אֶשֶׁר","transliteration":"ʼesher","pronunciation":"eh'-sher","strong":"H835","lemmaId":"hebrew:H835","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אַשְׁרֵ֣י","אַשְׁרֵ֤י","אַ֭שְׁרֵי","אַשְׁרֵ֥י","אַ֥שְֽׁרֵי"],"morphs":[["HNcmpa",36],["HC/Ncmpa",2],["HNcmpc/Sp2ms",2],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",2],["HNcmpc/Sp2fs",1],["HNcmpc/Sp2mp",1],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"happiness ; only in masculine plural construction as interjection, how happy!","usage":"blessed, happy.","full":"H835. esher [ אֶ֫שֶׁר , or אָשָׁר , compare Lag BN 143 ] noun [masculine] only Plural construct אַשְׁרֵי happiness , blessedness of 1Kin 10:8 32t. and with suffix, see below; abstract intensive exclamation O happiness, blessedness of , אֵלֶּה עֲבָדֶיךָ אַשְׁרֵי אֲנָשֶׁיךָ אַשְׁרֵי happy thy men, happy these thy servants ; 10:8 (= 2Chr 9:7 ); אֱלוֺהַּ יוֺכִיחֶנּוּ אֱנוֺשׁ אַשְׁרֵי blessed the man whom Eloah correcteth Job 5:17 ; דֶרֶךְ תְמִימֵי אַשְׁרֵי blessed the perfect in way Psa 119:1 ; אַחֲרָיו בָנָיו אַשְׁרֵי blessed his children after him Prov 20:7 ; elsewhere construct with אָדָם Psa 32:2 ; 84:6 ; Psalm 84:13; Prov 3:13 ; 8:34 ; 28:14 ; with הַגֶּבֶר Psa 34:9 ; 40:5 ; 94:12 ; 127:5 ; (הָ)אִישׁ 1:1 ; 112:1 ; אֱנוֺשׁ Isa 56:2 ; הַגּוֺי Psa 33:12 ; הָעָם 89:16 ; 144:15 (twice in verse); before participle 2:12 ; 32:1 ; 41:2 ; 84:5 ; 106:3 ; 119:2 ; 128:1 ; Isa 30:18 ; Dan 12:12 ; before verbal clauses without relative Psa 65:5 ; Prov 8:32 ; with שֶֿׁ Psa 137:8 ; 137:9 ; 146:5 ; with suffix אַשְׁרֶיךָ (for אֲשָׁרֶיךָ ) O thy happiness ! Deut 33:29 ; Psa 128:2 ; אַשְׁרֵיךְ Eccl 10:17 ; אַשְׁרֵיכֶס Isa 32:20 ; אַשְׁרָיו Prov 14:21 ; 16:20 ; אַשְׁרֵהוּ 29:18 (on these forms see Ges § 93 , R. 1, E).","rootNote":"from 833 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 10 8","keyReferences":["1Kgs 10 8","1Kgs 10 8","2Chr 9 7","2Chr 9 7","Dan 12 12","Deut 33 29","Eccl 10 17","Isa 30 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":45,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 10 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 10 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 9 7","book":"2Chr","chapter":9,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 9 7","book":"2Chr","chapter":9,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַשְׁרֵ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Dan 12 12","book":"Dan","chapter":12,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 33 29","book":"Deut","chapter":33,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֶ֨י/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Eccl 10 17","book":"Eccl","chapter":10,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵ֣י/ךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp2fs"},{"reference":"Isa 30 18","book":"Isa","chapter":30,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"Isa 32 20","book":"Isa","chapter":32,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַשְׁרֵי/כֶ֕ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp2mp"},{"reference":"Isa 56 2","book":"Isa","chapter":56,"ver